TEXT 224 608 Left 2 ;k: Schleiferstellung \n 0...100%
TEXT 784 688 Left 2 ;lin. Gleichungssystem:   k = 25% = 0,25 \n ---------------------- \n 1) (V1+V2)/Rp = I1*(1-k) + I2*k \n 2,4mA = I1*0,75  + I2*0,25 \n 2)         V2 =            I2*Rp*k    - I3*(R1+R2) \n 12V =            I2*2,5kOhm - I3*14.7kOhm \n 3)         0  = I1       - I2         - I3 \n ------------------------------------------------------- \n I1 = 2.31mA     I2 = 2.67mA  I3 = 0.362mA
